Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Revert: re-enable Fast Startup / Hibernation
; Pair with: disable-fast-startup.reg
; CURSOR-AUDIT #20: HiberbootEnabled=1 is the Windows default on most
; consumer SKUs. Run powercfg /hibernate on separately if hibernation
; was disabled (different setting; not in scope for this revert).

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Session Manager\Power]
"HiberbootEnabled"=dword:00000001
